Z||000005||Kelvin Vivian||09-18-2001||02:55 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Haze_Performance:<BR><B><BR>[b]1988 Breakdown by option</B><BR> <BR>T-Top: 91 coupes + 546 Formulas + 614 GTs = 1251 <BR>Leather interior: 1324 <BR>5 Speed: 2550 <P>[/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>For the number of 5-speeds, does that number just count the Getrags, or are Isuzu 5-spds included in that count too?<P>Thx,<BR>KV<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.printroom.com/_vti_bin/ViewImage.dll?userid=no_18&album_id=36084&image_id=3&courtesy=1">    <BR>88 GT, 5-spd<BR>87 SE 4-cyl, 5-spd||||reg||5
Z||000006||Haze_Performance||09-18-2001||03:08 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Kelvin Vivian:<BR><B> For the number of 5-speeds, does that number just count the Getrags, or are Isuzu 5-spds included in that count too?<P>Thx,<BR>KV<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>I believe that's Getrags only..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/84indyfierosig.jpg">     ---     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/RedandSilveratFierorama.jpg">    ---     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/halfpole_6.gif">   <BR><I><B><FONT COLOR="red">Classic Fiero Owners</B></I></FONT> - <FONT COLOR="red"><A HREF="http://www.WS6Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A></FONT>||||reg||1
