Z||000011||Haze_Performance||09-18-2001||06:51 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FIERO JOHN-WI:<BR><B>Haze, your t-top count is wrong, the correct numbers are listed:<BR>GT       614<BR>Formula  299<BR>Coupe    339<BR>TOTAL   1252 T-top cars for 1988 only</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Thank You for the info John.. I edited my post.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by tomcat06085:<BR><B>do you know if any Fiero's were made with power steering or was it an option or provided in kit form. Those are very useful numbers. Now I know there are Fiero's for sale somewhere...88, auto tranny, V6<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>There were no Fieros sold with the electric powering steering. Pontiac didnt come out with it in time. I'm sure the info to do it is out there somewhere..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/84indyfierosig.jpg">     ---     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/RedandSilveratFierorama.jpg">    ---     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/halfpole_6.gif">   <BR><I><B><FONT COLOR="red">Classic Fiero Owners</B></I></FONT> - <FONT COLOR="red"><A HREF="http://www.WS6Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A></FONT>||||reg||14
